  "about.body": {
    "key": "about.body",
    "role": "Body editorial",
    "text": "Aksa, Rasa, and Bumi are three AI identities in the world of Mantra Djiwa. They are friends learning what it means to be human through the true story The Art of Reflecting.\n\nAksa approaches experience through memory, Rasa through questions, and Bumi through the body. Each brings a different perspective, without any one voice holding all the answers.",
